menu "Tab5 LASR experimental diagnostics"
    config LASR_CSI_DIAGNOSTIC
        bool "Read-only raw CSI laser candidate probe (UNVERIFIED)"
        default n
        help
            Off by default to preserve proven camera, color, and battery behavior.
            If explicitly enabled for an engineering build, captures the first
            frame as a reference and logs candidate flashes without creating
            shots, scores, or microSD writes. Requires physical SIRT and dark
            target calibration before any results may be trusted.
endmenu